stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> DRAFT
 DRAFT --> SUBMITTED: Submit complete snapshot
 SUBMITTED --> REVIEW: Analyst claims
 REVIEW --> REVIEW: Validate or assess
 REVIEW --> INFO_REQUIRED: Request information
 INFO_REQUIRED --> SUBMITTED: Resubmit new snapshot
 REVIEW --> DECISION_PENDING: Recommend
 DECISION_PENDING --> REVIEW: Risk officer returns
 DECISION_PENDING --> REJECTED: Risk officer rejects
 DECISION_PENDING --> OFFERED: Approve and issue offer
 OFFERED --> ACCEPTED: Accept before deadline
 OFFERED --> DECLINED: Decline before deadline
 OFFERED --> EXPIRED: Materialize expiry
 DRAFT --> WITHDRAWN
 SUBMITTED --> WITHDRAWN
 REVIEW --> WITHDRAWN
 INFO_REQUIRED --> WITHDRAWN
